	"name": "Hammershot",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/weapons/guns/gun-blunderbuss-gold.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>By aiming to strike the same point on your target, again and again, you beat down their defenses with successive attacks. When you make an attack roll against a target, whether you hit or miss, your critical strike range against that target increases by 1. Successive attacks continue to increase your critical strike range to a maximum of 17-20. If you land a critical hit, roll a natural 1, or attack another target, your critical strike range increase is reset.</p>",
